## Why this handoff

C6c (Bug #5, §2 item 5 + §2d.5 + §2d.6) is bigger than the plan's four-site list reads, and six of the
decisions it needs are not settled in the plan. Dean asked for the plan to be discussed and updated
before I implement. Nothing is coded — C6c has **zero edits**. This handoff is the design surface.

One of the six is not a preference question but a **gap**: the plan's claim that finding (b) falls out
of the participation filter is incomplete as written (Q2). The rest are genuine forks.

