## Test plan I would build once the above is settled

Beyond the T1.4 rewrite: fsv ordering across two models with **different PRCs** (the case §2d.5 says
#1513 does not cover — `computeMean` / `sortByRemainingDesc` compare tokens/s against req/s today); a
`computeMean` fixture in replica space; a multi-role `fairShareCap` fixture; and a finding-(b) fixture
that pins both halves — demand with no usable PRC must not sort ahead, **and** must not resurface through
the fallback (Q2).

